You complete seven rounds of 8 muscle-ups and a 22-yard farmers carry with a pair of 50 lb / 35 lb dumbbells. That is 56 muscle-ups in all. The carry looks like a rest, but it squeezes the same grip and shoulders the muscle-ups need, so the rings get harder every round.',
   '[{"name": "Muscle-Ups", "reps": "8", "tip": "Use a false grip and a strong hip drive. Break into sets of 2 to 4 before you start missing reps."}, {"name": "Farmers Carry", "reps": "22 yd", "tip": "Stand tall, brace your core and walk quickly. Do not set the dumbbells down mid-carry if you can avoid it.", "rx_men": "50 lb dumbbells", "rx_women": "35 lb dumbbells"}]'::jsonb,
   'Record your finish time.',
   '["Break the muscle-ups early, not after a miss", "Walk the carry fast and shake out after", "Chalk before every set on the rings"]'::jsonb,
   '["Plan your muscle-up sets before you start, such as 3, 3 and 2, and hold that plan for all seven rounds.", "A failed muscle-up costs more energy than a short rest, so stop each set one rep before you think you will miss.", "On the carry, keep your shoulders pulled back and down and take short, quick steps.", "Shake out your hands and arms on the way back to the rings.", "Set the dumbbells down gently and in the same spot each round so the next carry starts fast."]'::jsonb,
   'Replace each muscle-up with 2 pull-ups plus 2 ring dips, or use banded or low-ring muscle-up transitions. Lower the dumbbells to 35 lb / 25 lb, or use kettlebells for the carry. Cut to 5 rounds if seven would take more than about 35 minutes.',
   '[{"question": "What is the Dobogai workout?", "answer": "7 rounds for time of 8 muscle-ups and a 22-yard farmers carry with 50 lb / 35 lb dumbbells."}, {"question": "How many muscle-ups are in Dobogai?", "answer": "56 muscle-ups in total, 8 in each of the seven rounds, plus 154 yards of farmers carry."}, {"question": "Who was Dobogai?", "answer": "U.S. Army Capt. Derek A. Dobogai, 26, of Fond du Lac, Wisconsin. He died on Aug. 22, 2007, in Multaka, Iraq, of injuries suffered when his unit''s helicopter crashed."}, {"question": "What if I cannot do muscle-ups yet?", "answer": "Do 2 pull-ups and 2 ring dips for each muscle-up, or practice banded muscle-up transitions."}]'::jsonb,
