   array['jumpRope','pullUpBar','barbell','running']::text[],
   'time',
   'Eva Strong honors Eva Mireles, 44, a fourth-grade teacher in her 17th year with the Uvalde Consolidated Independent School District. She died on May 24, 2022, while shielding her students from a gunman at Robb Elementary School in Uvalde, Texas. She ran before school, trained at her CrossFit gym almost every day and had taken part in the CrossFit Open nine times.

This is a partner workout: 5 rounds for time of 24 double-unders each, 19 toes-to-bar shared between you, 2 clean and jerks shared (205 lb / 135 lb), and a 400 m run together. That is 240 double-unders, 95 toes-to-bar and 10 heavy clean and jerks for the team, plus 2,000 m of running side by side.',
   '[{"name": "Double-Unders", "reps": "24 each", "tip": "Each partner does 24. Stay relaxed and spin the rope from your wrists."}, {"name": "Toes-to-Bar", "reps": "19 total", "tip": "Split the reps any way you like. Short sets and quick changes work best."}, {"name": "Clean and Jerks", "reps": "2 total", "tip": "Split them between partners. Take your time and make each rep count.", "rx_men": "205 lb", "rx_women": "135 lb"}, {"name": "Run", "reps": "400 m together", "tip": "Both partners run side by side. Run at the slower partner''s pace."}]'::jsonb,
   'Record your finish time.',
