   'Replace handstand push-ups with pike push-ups or box pike push-ups, or use a mat stack to shorten the range. Use a lower box, or step up. Replace each rope climb with 3 lying rope pulls to standing or a partial climb.',
   '[{"question": "What is the Falkel workout?", "answer": "As many rounds and reps as possible in 25 minutes of 8 handstand push-ups, 8 box jumps (30 in / 24 in) and 1 rope climb to 15 feet."}, {"question": "How is Falkel scored?", "answer": "Your score is total rounds plus any extra reps you complete before the 25 minutes end."}, {"question": "Who was Falkel?", "answer": "U.S. Army Staff Sgt. Chris Falkel, 22, of Highlands Ranch, Colorado, of the 3rd Special Forces Group. He was killed on Aug. 8, 2005, by enemy small-arms fire in Deh Afghan, Afghanistan."}, {"question": "What if I cannot do handstand push-ups?", "answer": "Use pike push-ups with your feet on a box, or a stack of mats under your head to shorten the range."}]'::jsonb,
